{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Man vs Cats</strong> is a multiplayer action hide-and-seek game where one player assumes the role of a human hunter tasked with catching all the cats, while up to four other players play as cats, hiding and accumulating power to retaliate against the human.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Human Role</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The human must use their listening skills to locate and catch all the cats before they can accumulate enough power to transform and seek revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519650/extras/3ca245b757bd83edfc1d6474b1a4e689.poster.avif?t=1772546529\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519650/extras/3ca245b757bd83edfc1d6474b1a4e689.webm?t=1772546529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519650/extras/3ca245b757bd83edfc1d6474b1a4e689.mp4?t=1772546529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cat Role</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Cats need to hide from the human while gathering energy needed to transform and retaliate with a more formidable form</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519650/extras/3df0f355649bbda7181912c0fdaba242.poster.avif?t=1772546529\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519650/extras/3df0f355649bbda7181912c0fdaba242.webm?t=1772546529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519650/extras/3df0f355649bbda7181912c0fdaba242.mp4?t=1772